                    "sense_definition": "A village and civil parish located in the New Forest district of Hampshire, England.",
                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "VeryLow",
                    "semantic_group_id": "",
                    "name_type": "place_name",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "We spent a quiet weekend visiting the charming village of <w>Sway</w> in Hampshire.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Мы провели тихие выходные, посетив очаровательную деревню <w>Суэй</w> в Гэмпшире."
